{"name": "Villages & Dungeons", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a <strong>flexible strategy</strong> card game infused with <strong>Rogue-lite</strong> elements, where every adventure brims with unpredictability. Confronting randomized dungeons, unexpected events, and a multiverse setting, each choice you make will forge a completely unique gaming experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Build Your Deck , Explore Endless Dungeons!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"81\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411020/extras/fc8af0c6569b4387a87d16824b8885f0.avif?t=1773844626\" width=\"800\"/></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The '1+4' minimalist deck-building system : 1 core card + 4 support cards</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Five elements : Water, Fire, Wood, Light, Dark \u2013 craft unpredictable builds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Diverse rune customization : unique abilities to elevate your combat experience<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411020/extras/14da32f2450a39c8a6f4cf6860e20afe.poster.avif?t=1773844626\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411020/extras/14da32f2450a39c8a6f4cf6860e20afe.webm?t=1773844626\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411020/extras/14da32f2450a39c8a6f4cf6860e20afe.mp4?t=1773844626\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=